            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system (10) comprising a surface (16); a scrim (18) discrete from the surface (16) and disposed at a boundary of the surface (16); and a projector system comprising one or more projectors is described. The projector system is configured to project light onto the surface (16) and onto the scrim (18) such that a first portion of the light reflected from the surface (16) generates a first portion of a simulated 3-D object and a second portion of the light reflected from the scrim (18) generates a second portion of the simulated 3-D object.</p>
            </abstract>
